//  id          unique text, no spaces (used in the product page link — don't change it once live)
//  name        product name
//  brand       optional — e.g. "Newman" (appears in the Brand filter)
//  category    must match one of the CATEGORIES ids below
//  type        what kind of item it is, e.g. "LED bulb" (appears in the Type filter)
//  price       price for one piece in GH₵, number only
//              use  price: null  to show "Price on request" (customers ask on WhatsApp)
//  oldPrice    optional — shows a "Sale" badge with the old price crossed out (and puts it in Deals)
//  bulk        optional — cheaper price per piece for larger quantities, e.g. bulk: [{ min: 4, price: 35 }]
//  unit        optional — what one piece is, e.g. "box", "roll", "metre" (default "piece")
//  description one or two sentences
//  specs       details shown in a table on the product page
//  image       optional — YOUR photo of the product, e.g. "images/products/fortune-18w.jpg"
//  examplePhoto optional — a stock photo of the same kind of item, labelled "Example photo"
//              (with neither, a coloured block with the icon and product name is shown)
//  gallery     optional — more photos shown as thumbnails on the product page, e.g.
//                gallery: ["images/products/inverter-back.jpg", "images/products/inverter-screen.jpg"]
//  together    optional — product ids for "Frequently bought together" (otherwise TOGETHER below is used)
//  stock       optional — 0 shows "Out of stock"; 1–5 shows "Only N left"
//  featured    optional — true shows it on the home page
//  badge       optional — a short label on the photo, e.g. "Best seller" or "New"
//  group       optional — products with the same group are versions of one item (e.g. sizes);
//  variant       the product page shows them as buttons, using each one's variant text
//  sample      true = DEMO product added for the presentation. Replace with real stock,
//              real prices and real photos (or delete) before launch. Products without it
//              come from the Light World sales book (confirmed by the owner).
//
//  Categories: photo   general photo of this kind of item (home page tile and category banner)
//              icon    line icon name (see ICONS in js/app.js)
//              tint    colour of the placeholder block for products without a photo
//              blurb   one line shown on the category banner
// ============================================================
